<item><title>São Tomé firm asks court to reverse Rosema brewery ruling</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-firm-asks-court-to-reverse-rosema-brewery-ruling-c3c4e1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-firm-asks-court-to-reverse-rosema-brewery-ruling-c3c4e1/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>The request seeks to undo the Constitutional Court ruling that restored possession, management and control of the brewery to Angola&apos;s private group RIDUX.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:08:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-firm-asks-court-to-reverse-rosema-brewery-ruling-c3c4e1/share.jpg" length="41547" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-firm-asks-court-to-reverse-rosema-brewery-ruling-c3c4e1/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>President faces test of his push to shape São Tomé government</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/president-faces-test-of-his-push-to-shape-sao-tome-e5fcaa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/president-faces-test-of-his-push-to-shape-sao-tome-e5fcaa/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>The president dismissed Patrice Trovoada’s government in January 2025, citing governance failures and public dissatisfaction, a Tela Non commentary recalls.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:07:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" length="38731" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
